+// arc-wasm (topic icu-once): ICU4J's ICUBinary maps the same .dat file again (its own
+// MappedByteBuffer). On a device both share the file's pages; here a mapping is a copy in
+// wasm memory (icudt55l.dat: 22 MB), so ICU4J reads ICU4C's mapping instead: a direct
